Snowdon - Simple HTTP Server CLI
================================

Version: 1.0.0
Author: James Theakston
Repository: https://github.com/jamestheakston/snowdon

A cross-platform CLI tool to start a web server for serving static files.
Works on macOS, Linux, and Windows.

Features:
- Serve any directory as a static website
- Customizable port
- Bind to specific network interfaces
- Built-in file upload GUI
- Directory listing with index.html fallback
- Stop/restart server commands
- Easy update mechanism

Requirements:
- Node.js 14 or higher
- Git (for updates)

For more information, visit: https://github.com/jamestheakston/snowdon
